---
import PageShell from '../../layouts/PageShell.astro';
---

<PageShell title="笔记" contentWidth="900px">
	<section>
		<h1>笔记</h1>
		<p>汇总现有的笔记板块，原来的板块作为子页面保留。</p>
		<ul class="entry-grid entry-grid--list">
			<li class="entry-card entry-card--compact">
				<a class="entry-link" href="/algorithms">
					<h2>题解</h2>
					<p>算法与数据结构练习题解，适合面试与进阶学习。</p>
				</a>
			</li>
			<li class="entry-card entry-card--compact">
				<a class="entry-link" href="/projects">
					<h2>项目</h2>
					<p>项目总结与实践案例，属于学习与成长过程的记录。</p>
				</a>
			</li>
			<li class="entry-card entry-card--compact">
				<a class="entry-link" href="/interview">
					<h2>八股</h2>
					<p>面试题、题型分析与复习资料，适合学习和备考。</p>
				</a>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>
</PageShell>
